1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,660
At Cura-chetra, Krsna halts the chariot.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,660
Argener sees his kin and teachers.

3
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,840
His breath catches his bow slits.

4
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:18,540
Krsna counsels action without attachment to reward.

5
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:21,520
The weight of Krsna remains.

6
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,000
Argener lifts his gaze listening.

7
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:29,000
Between the armies, he must understand what duty demands.
